The classic Brainfuck hello world from Wikipedia
Cells are bytes in the banked window at 0x4000 (on tape 1 when the machine
has two or more tapes)  Only the eight command characters mean anything;
everything else in this file is a comment  so the notes avoid the
plus minus angle bracket square bracket dot and comma characters

++++++++[>++++[>++>+++>+++>+<<<<-]>+>+>->>+[<]<-]>>.>---.+++++++..+++.>>.<-.<.+++.------.--------.>>+.>++.
